<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Novo Contato Recebido</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
            padding: 32px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .header p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 32px;
        }
        .intro-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #334155;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
        }
        .meta-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .meta-table td {
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
            font-size: 14px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .meta-table td.label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #475569;
            width: 120px;
        }
        .meta-table td.value {
            color: #0f172a;
        }
        .message-box {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
            border-radius: 4px 8px 8px 4px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }
        .message-box-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2563eb;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .message-box-body {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #334155;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 24px 32px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .footer p {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
        }
        .footer p:last-child {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #3b82f6;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <h1>Novo Contato Recebido</h1>
                <p>{% if tenant is defined and tenant and tenant.name %}{{ tenant.name }}{% else %}Website Oficial{% endif %}</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="content">
                <p class="intro-text">
                    Olá, você recebeu uma nova mensagem através do formulário de contato do site. Veja os detalhes abaixo:
                </p>
                
                <table class="meta-table">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">Nome</td>
                        <td class="value">{{ name }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">E-mail</td>
                        <td class="value"><a href="mailto:{{ sender_email }}" class="highlight">{{ sender_email }}</a></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">Telefone</td>
                        <td class="value">{{ phone }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">Data/Hora</td>
                        <td class="value">{{ submitted_at|date('d/m/Y \\à\\s H:i:s') }}</td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
                
                <div class="message-box">
                    <div class="message-box-title">Mensagem Enviada</div>
                    <div class="message-box-body">{{ message }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="footer">
                <p>Esta mensagem foi enviada de forma automática e segura pelo servidor do seu site.</p>
                <p>&copy; {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} {% if tenant is defined and tenant and tenant.name %}{{ tenant.name }}{% endif %}. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
